lHunt, and How are Security Startups in the GCC Region</title><link>https://mazinahmed.net/blog/interview-with-sectastic-podcast/</link><pubDate>Mon, 22 Mar 2021 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://mazinahmed.net/blog/interview-with-sectastic-podcast/</guid><description>&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10; &#10; &#10;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src="https://mazinahmed.net/uploads/assets/static/739a0909-9cc2-47d1-896d-2c727121881f.png" alt="" class="mx-auto my-0 rounded-md" /&gt;&#10;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;I did an interview with &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/miladca/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Milad Aslaner&lt;/a&gt; about how I started in cyber security, what I have been building at FullHunt, the concept of asset discovery and continuous security, and how I started one of the first cyber security startups in the GCC region.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;iframe width="560" height="310" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/qJjERXwM5wo" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="watch-on-youtube" class="relative group"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qJjERXwM5wo" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Watch on YouTube&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100"&gt;&lt;a class="group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700" style="text-decoration-line: none !important;" href="#watch-on-youtube" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 id="listen-on-spotify" class="relative group"&gt;&lt;a href="https://open.spotify.com/episode/5wFfNabozVKdwNfVpMNTm3" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"&gt;Listen on Spotify&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100"&gt;&lt;a class="group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700" style="text-decoration-line: none !important;" href="#listen-on-spotify" aria-la